# Variable NAMES only — no values, no export lines.
# Copy to ~/hermes-assistant/config/env.allowlist (edit here as bucephalus3)
# Synced to /home/hermes/.hermes-assistant/env.allowlist on each launch.
#
# When you start the stack from your shell, the wrapper copies values for
# these names from your current environment into the container. Everything
# else stays out.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
OPENAI_API_KEY
VENICE_API_KEY
# GITHUB_TOKEN
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY
